flowchart TD
    Start([Lab Manager Initiates Registration]) --> InputData[Enter Equipment Specs:<br/>Category, Model, Serial, Manufacturer,<br/>Purchase Date, Commissioning Date, Room]
    InputData --> PydanticVal{Pydantic Schema Validation}
    
    PydanticVal -- Fails --> ShowErr[Display Form Field Errors]
    ShowErr --> InputData
    
    PydanticVal -- Passes --> CheckSerial{Serial + Manufacturer<br/>Already Registered?}
    CheckSerial -- Duplicate --> Conflict[HTTP 409 Conflict:<br/>Serial Number Exists]
    Conflict --> InputData
    
    CheckSerial -- Unique --> GenCode[Auto-Generate Asset Code:<br/>HU-COLLEGE-DEPT-NNNN]
    GenCode --> GenQR[Generate Vector QR Payload:<br/>Configured ASSET_PUBLIC_BASE_URL/assets/scan?code=CODE<br/>or asset code only when unset]
    GenQR --> DBInsert[(Insert into assets Table<br/>Status: OPERATIONAL)]
    DBInsert --> AuditLog[(Write to audit_logs Table<br/>Action: ASSET_CREATED)]
    AuditLog --> PrintQR[Display Asset Passport &<br/>Render Printable QR Label]
    PrintQR --> Finish([Asset Tagged at Laboratory Bench])
